📊 Superset MCP Tools Already Available
Your MCP service can already:

List dashboards - list_dashboards()
List charts - list_charts()
Execute SQL - execute_sql(query, database_id)
Get dataset metadata - get_dataset_info(dataset_id)
Create charts - create_chart(dataset, visualization_type, ...)
Create dashboards - generate_dashboard(...)
Query metadata - get_column_info(table, column)
See: superset/mcp_service/tools/ for all available tools

